JasperReports Library – Open source and free. There is no recurring license cost to use it in your application. You can generate PDF, Excel, HTML, and other report formats without paying licensing fees.
Jaspersoft Studio – Open source and free. You can use it to design report templates (.jrxml) at no cost.
Jaspersoft Server
Community Edition: Free and open source.
Commercial Edition: Requires a paid subscription if you need enterprise features such as advanced security, clustering, auditing, high availability, professional support, and additional connectors.
Do you need to pay recurring costs?
No recurring cost if your application uses only:
JasperReports Library
Jaspersoft Studio
Community Edition of Jaspersoft Server (if it meets your needs)
Recurring subscription cost only if you choose the commercial enterprise edition for its additional features and vendor support.
